If the module's handler does not install a loader middleware yet, add one (see the module template's
`graphql/init.go`), building loaders per request.

Federation's `_entities` field has no directive. If `NewHandler` does not already gate it, add the
`AroundFields` hook from the module template's `graphql/init.go` so it runs `Authenticate` first, and a
test that a rejecting `Authenticate` blocks `_entities`. Tell the developer: existing entities in this
module become authenticated too, which is the intent.
